==================== 题目1-① 上传（目标不存在，直接上传） ====================
目标目录 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell 不存在，先创建
$ hdfs dfs -mkdir -p /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell
$ hdfs dfs -test -e /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
目标文件 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt 不存在，直接上传
$ hdfs dfs -put /home/yxy/文档/deepseek-harness/default-workspace/lab1-bigdata/part2-hdfs/local-shell/input.txt /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
已上传到 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
$ hdfs dfs -ls /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
-rw-r--r--   1 yxy supergroup         62 2026-10-02 00:24 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt

==================== 题目1-② 上传（目标已存在，指定 overwrite 覆盖） ====================
$ hdfs dfs -test -e /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
目标文件 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt 在 HDFS 中已存在
$ hdfs dfs -put -f /home/yxy/文档/deepseek-harness/default-workspace/lab1-bigdata/part2-hdfs/local-shell/input.txt /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
已把 /home/yxy/文档/deepseek-harness/default-workspace/lab1-bigdata/part2-hdfs/local-shell/input.txt 【覆盖】上传到 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
$ hdfs dfs -ls /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
-rw-r--r--   1 yxy supergroup         62 2026-10-02 00:24 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt

==================== 题目1-③ 上传（目标已存在，未指定模式 -> 由用户交互指定：这里输入 1 = 追加） ====================
$ hdfs dfs -test -e /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
目标文件 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt 在 HDFS 中已存在
请选择处理方式：[1] 追加到原有文件末尾 (append)  [2] 覆盖原有的文件 (overwrite)
$ hdfs dfs -appendToFile /home/yxy/文档/deepseek-harness/default-workspace/lab1-bigdata/part2-hdfs/local-shell/more.txt /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
已把 /home/yxy/文档/deepseek-harness/default-workspace/lab1-bigdata/part2-hdfs/local-shell/more.txt 的内容【追加】到 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt 末尾
$ hdfs dfs -ls /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
-rw-r--r--   1 yxy supergroup        120 2026-10-02 00:24 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt

==================== 题目2-① 下载（本地无同名文件） ====================
$ hdfs dfs -test -e /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
$ hdfs dfs -get /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt /home/yxy/文档/deepseek-harness/default-workspace/lab1-bigdata/part2-hdfs/local-shell/download/upload.txt
-rw-r--r-- 1 yxy yxy 120 10月  2 00:24 /home/yxy/文档/deepseek-harness/default-workspace/lab1-bigdata/part2-hdfs/local-shell/download/upload.txt

==================== 题目2-② 下载（本地已有同名文件 -> 自动重命名） ====================
$ hdfs dfs -test -e /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
本地已存在同名文件 upload.txt，自动重命名：
  -> upload.txt.1
$ hdfs dfs -get /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt /home/yxy/文档/deepseek-harness/default-workspace/lab1-bigdata/part2-hdfs/local-shell/download/upload.txt.1
-rw-r--r-- 1 yxy yxy 120 10月  2 00:24 /home/yxy/文档/deepseek-harness/default-workspace/lab1-bigdata/part2-hdfs/local-shell/download/upload.txt.1
-- 本地下载目录内容：
总计 8
-rw-r--r-- 1 yxy yxy 120 10月  2 00:24 upload.txt
-rw-r--r-- 1 yxy yxy 120 10月  2 00:24 upload.txt.1

==================== 题目3 把 HDFS 中指定文件的内容输出到终端 ====================
$ hdfs dfs -cat /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
Hello HDFS
大数据系统基本实验
实验一 第 2 部分
===== 用户选择「追加」时写入的这一行 =====

==================== 题目4 显示指定文件的权限、大小、创建时间、路径 ====================
$ hdfs dfs -ls /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
-rw-r--r--   1 yxy supergroup        120 2026-10-02 00:24 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
-- 用 -stat 精确取各项属性（%a 权限 %b 大小 %y 修改时间 %n 路径）
$ hdfs dfs -stat '权限=%a 大小=%b 字节 修改时间=%y 路径=%n' /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt
权限=644 大小=120 字节 修改时间=2026-10-01 16:24:11 路径=upload.txt

==================== 题目5 递归显示指定目录下所有文件的信息 ====================
$ hdfs dfs -ls -R /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell
-rw-r--r--   1 yxy supergroup        120 2026-10-02 00:24 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/upload.txt

==================== 题目6-① 创建文件（所在目录不存在 -> 自动创建目录） ====================
$ hdfs dfs -test -e /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/newdir1/newdir2
文件所在目录 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/newdir1/newdir2 不存在，自动创建
$ hdfs dfs -mkdir -p /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/newdir1/newdir2
$ hdfs dfs -touchz /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/newdir1/newdir2/created.txt
已创建文件：/user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/newdir1/newdir2/created.txt
$ hdfs dfs -ls /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/newdir1/newdir2/created.txt
-rw-r--r--   1 yxy supergroup          0 2026-10-02 00:24 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/newdir1/newdir2/created.txt

