已上传到 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/nonempty/sub/keep.txt
$ hdfs dfs -ls /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/nonempty/sub/keep.txt
-rw-r--r--   1 yxy supergroup         62 2026-10-02 00:24 /user/yxy/hdfs-lab-shell/nonempty/sub/keep.txt

